==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|theoretical|ly|lang=en}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# in [[theory]]; [[on paper]]
#: ''I haven't tested it, but '''theoretically''' it ought to fly.''
# in a [[theoretical]] manner
#: ''I solved the problem '''theoretically''' rather than practically.''

